  "generated_description": "<div class=\"mountain-description prose prose-stone max-w-none\">\n  <p>At 11,749 feet, <strong>Mount Timpanogos</strong> is a summit in Utah. It has roughly 5,269 feet of topographic prominence. The Mount Timpanogos Trail is a 2.1-mile hike with about 1,227 feet of elevation gain. Nearby peaks include Mount Nebo, Middle Nebo Peak and South Nebo Peak. Trail data is sourced from OpenStreetMap contributors (ODbL); verify current conditions with the official land manager before you go.</p>\n</div>",
